<h2 style=3D"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;">Gardens that c=
ool whole streets</h2>
<p style=3D"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:17px;">=
Researchers spent two years mapping how small neighbourhood gardens change =
local temperatures. The results surprised even the team: a single street of=
 planted verges cooled nearby pavements by several degrees on the hottest a=
fternoons.</p>
